# XIOM XVECTOR -- line-ending rules.
# The bash twins (scripts/*.sh) are consumed by WSL/Linux: they must stay
# LF in the working tree or bash fails on the CR in the shebang/commands,
# even on a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true here). XIOM sources (*.xi)
# are kept LF for tooling parity.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.xi text eol=lf
